╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│                                                                                                                    │
│  Select an option:                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                    │
│  ▸ Install sysc-lock                                                                                               │
│      Builds sysc-lock and installs the binary and user unit                                                        │
│                                                                                                                    │
│    Uninstall sysc-lock                                                                                             │
│      Removes the binary and user unit                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                    │
│  Runs as you. Writes only under the prefix; never enables services or edits PAM.                                   │
│                                                                                                                    │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

                                   ↑/↓: Navigate  •  Enter: Continue  •  Ctrl+C: Quit                                   
